    report_lines = ""
    if reporting.get("enabled", False):
        report_lines = f"""
Final report contract:
- when completed_iterations reaches target_iterations, do not start a new iteration
- instead generate the final report required by evaluation.yaml
- write the final markdown report to {reporting.get('final_report', paths.final_report_md)}
- write plots/figures to {reporting.get('plots_dir', paths.plots_dir)}
- include the required sections: {reporting.get('required_sections', [])}
- use versions.md and runtime/results as the canonical evidence sources
- once the report is complete, set report_generated=true, report_status=report-complete, last_report_time to the current UTC timestamp, and status=complete in {paths.state_json}
- if report generation fails, set status=report-failed with an explanation in notes
"""
    return f"""Read the project pack before doing anything and treat {paths.agent_md} as binding.

Project-pack files to read:
- {paths.mission_md}
- {paths.agent_md}
- {paths.repo_guide_md}
- {paths.evaluation_yaml}
- {paths.git_yaml}
- {paths.supervisor_yaml}
- {paths.secrets_ref}
{chr(10).join(_skill_file_lines(paths))}

Campaign workspace:
- workspace root: {paths.root}
- runtime state file: {paths.state_json}
- canonical version log: {paths.versions_md}
- results dir: {paths.results_dir}

