- repo root: {git_cfg['repo_root']}

Current campaign state:
- status: {state['status']}
- completed_iterations: {state['completed_iterations']}
- next_iteration: {state['next_iteration']}
- target_iterations: {state['target_iterations']}

Execution contract:
- respect the project pack exactly
- update {paths.state_json} as the source of truth for campaign progress
- append completed iteration records to {paths.versions_md}
- write per-iteration artifacts under {paths.results_dir}
- follow the evaluation contract from evaluation.yaml
- follow the git policy from git.yaml
